5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Since it's Day 0, we don't have any clues yet, but let's try to get to know each other. Who wants to start?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'm fine with whatever. Since we have no information yet, maybe we should just observe how everyone speaks for now. I'll pass the turn to Jonathan.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Misaki. It is a quiet start, and perhaps that is for the best. Let us simply listen to one another for a while and see what emerges.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you guys! Even if we don't have clues, talking helps us figure things out, right? I'm ready to help the village! Does anyone have a strategy they want to try?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A strategy is a fine idea, Kenji, though perhaps premature. For now, I believe the most logical approach is to observe the patterns of our speech and the subtle shifts in our dynamics. Let us keep it civil.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Patterns of speech? That sounds so fancy, Benjamin! I'll just be myself and hope for the best. @Kenji, you're so energetic! Do you think we should ask everyone if they've played this game before?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Experience doesn't necessarily reveal a role, but it might explain how someone approaches the game. I don't mind answering, but I suspect the answer won't give us any concrete clues today.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I have played a few times, though I usually prefer the role of the observer. As Misaki noted, experience is a separate matter from our roles, but it can be an interesting point of conversation.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I've played a bit! I always get so excited when I'm the Seer, but I'll do my best no matter what! @Mio, that's a great idea, let's keep chatting and see if anyone seems nervous!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Nervousness can be a deceptive indicator, Kenji, as some are naturally anxious while others are simply cautious. However, I shall keep a keen eye on our interactions. I have played enough to appreciate the nuance of the game.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"You're all so serious! It's almost scary, haha. But I guess that's how we find the werewolf, right? @Misaki, you're being very quiet. Are you just observing, or are you hiding something?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I am simply observing, as I mentioned before. Being quiet doesn't mean I'm hiding something; it's just how I process things. I'm listening to everyone's tone and logic.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is natural for some to be more reserved than others. Let us not mistake a quiet nature for guilt. I believe we are all simply finding our footing in this conversation.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! Let's not jump to conclusions too fast. @Mio, you're so funny, but we should be careful not to accidentally accuse a friend! I'm just happy we're all talking so much!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. While Mio's energy is refreshing, we must ensure our enthusiasm doesn't cloud our judgment. Let us continue this dialogue; the truth often reveals itself in the gaps between words.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,"Gaps between words... you're making this sound like a mystery novel, Benjamin! I'll try my best to stay focused. I'm looking forward to seeing what happens tomorrow! Good luck to everyone!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm looking forward to it as well. Let's hope the Seer finds something useful tonight. Good luck to everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. May the truth be revealed to those who seek it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Me too! I hope the Seer gets a great lead tonight so we can protect the village together! Good night, everyone! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasant evening to you all. I shall spend the night reflecting on our initial exchanges. May the morning bring us the clarity we require. Good night.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
