34,1,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. Now that it's Day 1, things are getting real! Did the Seer find anything interesting last night? I'm dying to know if we have a lead!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's too early for the Seer to reveal everything immediately, as that would make them a target. However, if they found a werewolf, they might choose to speak. @Jonathan, @Benjamin, do either of you have anything to share?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have indeed found something. It is a heavy burden to share so early, but for the sake of the village, I must be honest. My divination reveals that Mio is the werewolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, what?! @Mio is the werewolf? I can't believe it! You seemed so happy and energetic! @Jonathan, are you absolutely sure? This is a huge lead if it's true! What do you think, everyone?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"This is a significant revelation, Jonathan. While Mio's cheerfulness could be a facade, we must consider the risk: if Jonathan is the werewolf lying to frame her, he has just exposed himself as the Seer. It is a bold move. @Mio, your response?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mio,,"What?! @Jonathan, that's not true! I'm not the werewolf! I can't believe you'd say that! I've been nothing but friendly! Why would you lie about me? This is just a big mistake!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, your reaction is quite emotional, which is expected, but it doesn't prove innocence. @Jonathan, you've put yourself in a vulnerable position by claiming the Seer role so early. Are you certain there's no room for error?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am certain. The vision was clear, and there is no room for error in the Seer's sight. I understand the risk I take, but the safety of the village outweighs my own.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I trust Jonathan! He's always so calm and gentle, I can't imagine him lying like that. @Mio, I'm really sorry, but if the Seer says so, we have to listen! What do you guys think? Should we vote?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Let us pause for a moment, Kenji. While Jonathan's demeanor is comforting, we must rely on logic. If Jonathan is the Seer, Mio is the wolf. If Jonathan is the wolf, he is sacrificing his cover to eliminate Mio. @Mio, any counter-argument?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I don't have a counter-argument other than the truth! I'm just a villager! @Jonathan, why are you doing this? It's so mean! Please, everyone, don't believe him just because he's calm! He's trying to trick you all!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, appealing to emotion is a common tactic. @Jonathan, your conviction is strong, but we must be careful. If we execute Mio and she is innocent, we lose a villager and the wolf remains. However, the Seer's lead is our only concrete clue.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand the risk, Misaki. However, the cost of hesitation is often higher than the cost of a mistake. I speak the truth with a clear heart; I believe Mio is the one we must remove.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with Jonathan! He's being so honest and brave by telling us right away. @Mio, I really want to believe you, but we can't ignore the Seer's vision. Let's trust the lead and protect the village!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The logic is straightforward: we have a direct conflict between Jonathan and Mio. If Jonathan is the Seer, Mio must go. If he is the wolf, he is playing a high-risk game. Given the evidence, the most rational choice is to trust the Seer.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mio,,"This is so unfair! I can't believe you're all turning on me just because of one person's word! @Benjamin, @Misaki, please think about this! If you kill me, you're just helping the real werewolf! I'm innocent, I swear!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I've listened to both sides. While I sympathize with your distress, Mio, the Seer's claim is too direct to ignore. If we don't act on this information, we are essentially gambling with the village's safety. I will vote for Mio.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I feel for you, Mio, but my vision does not lie. For the peace and safety of our community, I must remain steadfast in my revelation. I will cast my vote for Mio.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm really sorry, Mio, but I have to trust Jonathan! He's being so brave by coming forward. We have to do what's best for the village, even if it's hard. I'm voting for Mio!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a regrettable situation, but the probability favors Jonathan's claim. To ignore a Seer's direct identification would be illogical. I shall join the majority to ensure the village's security. I vote for Mio.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
